          "english_quote": "by every prophetic test",
          "issue": "The articular singular presents the prophetic examination in its entirety. The draft instead uses a distributive expression for individual tests. Although this conveys comprehensive testing broadly, it obscures the source's formulation.",
          "suggested_revision": "Use “by the full prophetic examination” or “with the whole prophetic examination,” retaining the comprehensive force without recasting the singular examination as individual tests. The revised wording requires fresh review.",
